[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2652222054","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102155#issuecomment-2652222054","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102155","id":2652222054,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eFbJm","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-11T22:39:16Z","updated_at":"2025-02-11T22:39:16Z","body":"> * broken in 4.4beta 1\n> * broken in 4.4dev3\n> * works in 4.3 stable\n\nIs 4.4.dev3 the first broken snapshot, i.e. does it work well in 4.4.dev2?\n\nWhich driver do you have configured in `input_devices/pen_tablet/driver.windows`? Can you try both `winink` and `wintab` to see if there's a difference?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2652222054/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2652344906","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102155#issuecomment-2652344906","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102155","id":2652344906,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eF5JK","user":{"login":"Jordyfel","id":76705401,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzA1NDAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76705401?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordyfel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-12T00:16:05Z","updated_at":"2025-02-12T00:16:05Z","body":"Cannot reproduce, buttons work properly for me with both drivers on a \"one by wacom\" (ctl-472) device","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2652344906/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2653431201","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102155#issuecomment-2653431201","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102155","id":2653431201,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eKCWh","user":{"login":"Jowan-Spooner","id":42868150,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODY4MTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42868150?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jowan-Spooner","html_url":"https://github.com/Jowan-Spooner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jowan-Spooner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jowan-Spooner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jowan-Spooner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jowan-Spooner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jowan-Spooner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jowan-Spooner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jowan-Spooner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jowan-Spooner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jowan-Spooner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-12T11:25:12Z","updated_at":"2025-02-12T11:25:12Z","body":"> Is 4.4.dev3 the first broken snapshot, i.e. does it work well in 4.4.dev2?\n\nIt was just the earliest 4.4dev version I had still installed, but now I retested dev1 and dev2 and it turns out dev3 actually is the first broken snapshot as far as I can tell.\n\n> Which driver do you have configured in input_devices/pen_tablet/driver.windows? Can you try both winink and wintab to see if there's a difference?\n\nOh wow, yes, switching to `wintab` did fix this (had none specified before). It was a bit unexpected to find this project setting effecting the editor as well, but oh well. From what I can find online wintab is just a really old API? So this is probably just caused by using a fairly old tablet? Still a bit strange that it works fine with both drivers in 4.3. Is there a downside to using wintab in a project? Would we have to implement a setting in material maker to switch between those two drivers?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2653431201/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2653456395","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102155#issuecomment-2653456395","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102155","id":2653456395,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eKIgL","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-12T11:35:29Z","updated_at":"2025-02-12T11:35:29Z","body":"> Oh wow, yes, switching to wintab did fix this (had none specified before).\n\nDo you have `Use Windows Ink` in the tablet properties unchecked? Not sure if it's still possible to disable it, it seems to be grayed out on Windows 11. But it at least should be enabled by default. The setting page should look like this:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/33af1b8a-f3b0-41d1-b5bc-5e3debf1cd57)\n\nIf it's disabled, I guess it is expected not to work unless Godot is also set to use `wintab`.\n\nDefault setting was switched since a lot of third-party tablet manufacturers ship half broken implementations of `wintab.dll` (Wacom original is fine).\n\nNot sure if we can detect if what's configured in the table properties, but it might be worth at least checking the setting for Wacom and auto switch Godot to `wintab`.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2653456395/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2653472893","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102155#issuecomment-2653472893","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102155","id":2653472893,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eKMh9","user":{"login":"Jowan-Spooner","id":42868150,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODY4MTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42868150?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jowan-Spooner","html_url":"https://github.com/Jowan-Spooner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jowan-Spooner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jowan-Spooner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jowan-Spooner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jowan-Spooner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jowan-Spooner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jowan-Spooner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jowan-Spooner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jowan-Spooner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jowan-Spooner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-12T11:43:33Z","updated_at":"2025-02-12T11:43:33Z","body":"Thanks! That does work for me. I will forward this to the user who originally reported this to me for the material maker alpha releases. \n\nIn my opinion this information does make this issue way less of a deal breaker even though it still does break compatibility. Thank you all for the quick input!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2653472893/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]